  "question": {
    "text": "A solution curve of differential equation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0&#160;</mn></math>&nbsp;passes through the point (1, 3). Then the solution curve -",
